// What one gathering of an iron vein yields (phase 8). Copper and silver
// come along now and then, mithril rarely.
(entries: [
    (item: "iron_ore", chance: 1000, qty: (1, 3)),
    (item: "copper_ore", chance: 400, qty: (1, 2)),
    (item: "silver_ore", chance: 80),
    (item: "mithril_ore", chance: 3),
])
